        "Abstract": "Event Extraction (EE) is a fundamental task in Information Extraction (IE) that aims to recognize event mentions and their arguments from text. This paper proposes a novel Multilingual Event Extraction dataset (MEE) that provides annotation for more than 50K event mentions in 8 typologically different languages."
